---
title: Shapes of a release
---
flowchart LR
    commit([Commit]) --> build[[Build]]
    build --> tests{Tests pass?}
    tests -- yes --> store[(Artifact store)]
    tests -- no --> fix>Fix the build]
    fix --> build
    store --> sign[/Sign/] --> stage[\Stage\] --> ship((Ship))
    ship --> notes@{ shape: doc, label: "Release notes" }
    ship --> notify{{Notify}}
    notify --> wait@{ shape: delay, label: "Wait a day" }
    wait --> done(((Done)))
